{
  "book": "3nephi",
  "bookName": "3 Nephi",
  "chapter": 10,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 299.759,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.108,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, it came to pass that all the people of the land did hear these sayings,",
      "verse": "10:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.288,
      "end": 7.006,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did witness of it.",
      "verse": "10:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.186,
      "end": 12.109,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after these sayings there was silence in the land for the space of many hours;",
      "verse": "10:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 12.789,
      "end": 15.622,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For so great was the astonishment of the people",
      "verse": "10:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 15.802,
      "end": 18.449,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they did cease lamenting and howling",
      "verse": "10:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 18.629,
      "end": 21.973,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the loss of their kindred which had been slain;",
      "verse": "10:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 22.153,
      "end": 26.843,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore there was silence in all the land for the space of many hours.",
      "verse": "10:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 27.523,
      "end": 31.749,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that there came a voice again unto the people,",
      "verse": "10:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 31.929,
      "end": 33.647,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all the people did hear,",
      "verse": "10:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 33.827,
      "end": 35.731,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did witness of it, saying:",
      "verse": "10:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 36.411,
      "end": 37.572,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O ye people",
      "verse": "10:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 37.752,
      "end": 40.538,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of these great cities which have fallen,",
      "verse": "10:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 40.718,
      "end": 42.901,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who are descendants of Jacob,",
      "verse": "10:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 43.081,
      "end": 45.589,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, who are of the house of Israel,",
      "verse": "10:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 45.769,
      "end": 47.534,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "how oft have I gathered you",
      "verse": "10:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 47.714,
      "end": 51.104,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as a hen gathereth her chickens under her wings,",
      "verse": "10:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 51.284,
      "end": 52.724,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have nourished you.",
      "verse": "10:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 53.404,
      "end": 56.098,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, how oft would I have gathered you",
      "verse": "10:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 56.278,
      "end": 59.668,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as a hen gathereth her chickens under her wings,",
      "verse": "10:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 59.848,
      "end": 63.888,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, O ye people of the house of Israel, who have fallen;",
      "verse": "10:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 64.068,
      "end": 66.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, O ye people of the house of Israel,",
      "verse": "10:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 66.663,
      "end": 69.635,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye that dwell at Jerusalem, as ye that have fallen;",
      "verse": "10:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 69.815,
      "end": 72.323,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, how oft would I have gathered you",
      "verse": "10:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 72.503,
      "end": 75.8,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as a hen gathereth her chickens, and ye would not.",
      "verse": "10:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 76.48,
      "end": 81.496,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O ye house of Israel whom I have spared, how oft will I gather you",
      "verse": "10:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 81.676,
      "end": 85.066,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as a hen gathereth her chickens under her wings,",
      "verse": "10:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 85.246,
      "end": 89.426,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if ye will repent and return unto me with full purpose of heart.",
      "verse": "10:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 90.106,
      "end": 92.428,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But if not, O house of Israel,",
      "verse": "10:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 92.608,
      "end": 96.23,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the places of your dwellings shall become desolate",
      "verse": "10:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 96.41,
      "end": 100.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until the time of the fulfilling of the covenant to your fathers.",
      "verse": "10:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 101.13,
      "end": 105.402,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that after the people had heard these words,",
      "verse": "10:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 105.582,
      "end": 111.201,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, they began to weep and howl again because of the loss of their kindred and friends.",
      "verse": "10:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 111.881,
      "end": 115.643,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that thus did the three days pass away.",
      "verse": "10:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 115.823,
      "end": 117.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it was in the morning,",
      "verse": "10:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 117.768,
      "end": 121.437,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the darkness dispersed from off the face of the land,",
      "verse": "10:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 121.617,
      "end": 123.707,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the earth did cease to tremble,",
      "verse": "10:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 123.887,
      "end": 126.209,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the rocks did cease to rend,",
      "verse": "10:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 126.389,
      "end": 128.711,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the dreadful groanings did cease,",
      "verse": "10:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 128.891,
      "end": 131.585,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all the tumultuous noises did pass away.",
      "verse": "10:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 132.265,
      "end": 135.98,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the earth did cleave together again, that it stood;",
      "verse": "10:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 136.16,
      "end": 140.107,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the mourning, and the weeping, and the wailing",
      "verse": "10:10",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 140.287,
      "end": 143.073,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of the people who were spared alive did cease;",
      "verse": "10:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 143.253,
      "end": 145.621,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their mourning was turned into joy,",
      "verse": "10:10",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 145.801,
      "end": 150.399,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their lamentations into the praise and thanksgiving unto the Lord Jesus Christ,",
      "verse": "10:10",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 150.579,
      "end": 151.879,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their Redeemer.",
      "verse": "10:10",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 152.559,
      "end": 157.482,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus far were the scriptures fulfilled which had been spoken by the prophets.",
      "verse": "10:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 158.162,
      "end": 161.645,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it was the more righteous part of the people who were saved,",
      "verse": "10:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 161.825,
      "end": 165.633,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it was they who received the prophets and stoned them not;",
      "verse": "10:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 165.813,
      "end": 170.318,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it was they who had not shed the blood of the saints, who were spared\u2014",
      "verse": "10:12",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 170.998,
      "end": 176.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were spared and were not sunk and buried up in the earth;",
      "verse": "10:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 176.379,
      "end": 179.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were not drowned in the depths of the sea;",
      "verse": "10:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 179.67,
      "end": 181.899,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were not burned by fire,",
      "verse": "10:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 182.079,
      "end": 185.19,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither were they fallen upon and crushed to death;",
      "verse": "10:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 185.37,
      "end": 187.692,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were not carried away in the whirlwind;",
      "verse": "10:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 187.872,
      "end": 192.237,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither were they overpowered by the vapor of smoke and of darkness.",
      "verse": "10:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 192.917,
      "end": 195.518,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, whoso readeth, let him understand;",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 195.698,
      "end": 198.856,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he that hath the scriptures, let him search them,",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 199.036,
      "end": 203.959,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and see and behold if all these deaths and destructions by fire, and by smoke,",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 204.139,
      "end": 206.507,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by tempests, and by whirlwinds,",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 206.687,
      "end": 209.613,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by the opening of the earth to receive them,",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 209.793,
      "end": 216.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all these things are not unto the fulfilling of the prophecies of many of the holy prophets.",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 217.207,
      "end": 218.879,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I say unto you,",
      "verse": "10:15",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 219.059,
      "end": 222.867,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, many have testified of these things at the coming of Christ,",
      "verse": "10:15",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 223.047,
      "end": 224.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were slain",
      "verse": "10:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 224.481,
      "end": 226.803,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because they testified of these things.",
      "verse": "10:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 227.483,
      "end": 230.687,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, the prophet Zenos did testify of these things,",
      "verse": "10:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 230.867,
      "end": 233.7,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also Zenock spake concerning these things,",
      "verse": "10:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 233.88,
      "end": 237.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because they testified particularly concerning us,",
      "verse": "10:16",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 237.404,
      "end": 239.819,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who are the remnant of their seed.",
      "verse": "10:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 240.499,
      "end": 245.375,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, our father Jacob also testified concerning a remnant of the seed of Joseph.",
      "verse": "10:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 245.555,
      "end": 249.317,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, are not we a remnant of the seed of Joseph?",
      "verse": "10:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 249.497,
      "end": 251.865,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And these things which testify of us,",
      "verse": "10:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 252.045,
      "end": 254.971,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are they not written upon the plates of brass",
      "verse": "10:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 255.151,
      "end": 258.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which our father Lehi brought out of Jerusalem?",
      "verse": "10:17",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 258.803,
      "end": 263.401,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that in the ending of the thirty and fourth year,",
      "verse": "10:18",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 263.581,
      "end": 265.671,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, I will show unto you",
      "verse": "10:18",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 265.851,
      "end": 273.096,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the people of Nephi who were spared, and also those who had been called Lamanites,",
      "verse": "10:18",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 273.276,
      "end": 274.809,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had been spared,",
      "verse": "10:18",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 274.989,
      "end": 277.868,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "did have great favors shown unto them,",
      "verse": "10:18",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 278.048,
      "end": 280.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and great blessings poured out upon their heads,",
      "verse": "10:18",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 280.968,
      "end": 284.73,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that soon after the ascension of Christ into heaven",
      "verse": "10:18",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 284.91,
      "end": 287.325,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he did truly manifest himself unto them\u2014",
      "verse": "10:18",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 288.005,
      "end": 291.999,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Showing his body unto them, and ministering unto them;",
      "verse": "10:19",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 292.179,
      "end": 295.523,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and an account of his ministry shall be given hereafter.",
      "verse": "10:19",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 295.703,
      "end": 299.093,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore for this time I make an end of my sayings.",
      "verse": "10:19",
      "lineIndex": 86
    }
  ]
}